23818	23897	23816	23816	Sydney	90	" and I do not know any other way of getting a wetting at this sport . Mrs Rowland should have seen George and me climbing the old oak at the two - mile turning . I dared George to it , and there he hung over the water , at the end of the branch , riding up and down like a see - saw . She would think nothing of letting him go fishing after that . "
23898	23905	23907	23908	Mr Enderby	98	" If the branch had broken , "
