84594	84602	84604	84604	Margaret	93	" I am glad you think so , "
84608	84669	84604	84604	Margaret	93	" You can not imagine how strange it is to see Mrs Grey and others taking for granted that he is free , when Hester and I could tell them in a moment what Mrs Rowland said . But if you think Mrs Rowland is all wrong , what do you really suppose about his coming so much to Deerbrook ? "
