239936	240039	239933	239934	Dr Levitt	96	" I have been inquiring for you , but your household could give me no account of you . Could you just step home with me ? Or come to me in the evening , will you ? But stay ! There is no time like the present , after all ; so , if you will allow me , I will walk in with you now ; and , if you are going to dinner , I will make one . I have nobody to sit down with me at home at present , you know,--or perhaps you do not know . "
