259954	260037	259902	259902	Hope	103	" For Enderby 's justification , and for Margaret 's sake , my name shall be joined with the arch - fiend 's , if necessary , my love . You must , as I was saying , rely upon the testimony of those who know the whole , that Enderby 's conduct throughout has been , if not the very wisest and best , perfectly natural , and consistent with the love for Margaret which he has cherished to this hour . "
